# Format: model_name,base_url,api_key,phases(optional; separated by |),aliases(optional; separated by |)
# Workflow phases: default, direct, readrepo, phase2, phase3, check
# 
# Example:
# provider/model-name,https://api.provider.com/v1/,your-api-key-here,default|direct|readrepo|phase2|phase3|check,alias
#
# Fill in your API keys below. This file is gitignored by default.
# You can also use environment variables OPENROUTER_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY etc.
